00:09:42.879 --> 00:09:46.879
I mean, level three, Metro Pharmaceuticals, 33.1.

00:09:46.879 --> 00:09:48.879
Clark, all these projects are dead.

00:09:48.879 --> 00:09:50.879
Maybe he revised something from years ago.

00:09:50.879 --> 00:09:54.879
Way back when there wasn't much digital record to track.

00:09:54.879 --> 00:09:57.879
You know, Clark, if they did a story on this at the Daily Planet,

00:09:57.879 --> 00:09:59.879
they would have a hard copy store in the archives.

00:09:59.879 --> 00:10:00.879
I didn't give it.

00:10:00.879 --> 00:10:03.879
Get rid is odd just to let some other evil take his place.

00:10:03.879 --> 00:10:13.200
Lana.

