That was bold.

00:11:36.639 --> 00:11:41.639
Robbing women from the shadows, lip-smacking them, and then running off into the night.

00:11:41.639 --> 00:11:45.639
It kind of makes you wonder what are the little twisted fetishes he has in his toolbox.

00:11:45.639 --> 00:11:49.620
So, Clark, did you come here for a reason?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.620
A pressing story, maybe?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.620
story maybe?

