Found it.

00:12:29.429 --> 00:12:31.429
Lucky for me, it was right here on top of these files.

00:12:31.429 --> 00:12:41.779
Wait, Clark.

00:12:41.779 --> 00:12:43.779
Yeah, Lois, what is it?

00:12:43.779 --> 00:12:48.059
We need to talk.

00:12:48.059 --> 00:12:49.059
Well, I get now is not the time.

