Who was that?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.870
Not chosen.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.870
Love these days.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:24.870
Navajo.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.870
Chloe, where are you?

