We ditch this little blindfold here and go full Monty, huh?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.250
You up for that?

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.250
Well, only seems fair you not see me?

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:50.519
The world's sad blind

