You got this whole thing wrong, okay?

00:15:28.279 --> 00:15:32.279
I want you call a good guy here!

00:15:32.279 --> 00:15:34.279
I'm not guilty of anything, so I'm trying to save the world.

00:15:34.279 --> 00:15:40.100
They're trying to save the world, all right?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:44.210
And I would tell you who from.

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.210
I don't think you'd believe me.

