00:23:21.809 --> 00:24:07.359
You've missed it for the world.

00:24:07.359 --> 00:24:08.359
Tess, what happened?

00:24:08.359 --> 00:24:12.660
I left you at the hospital, your face.

00:24:12.660 --> 00:24:14.660
I have no idea how I got here.

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:15.660
But when I woke up, I was going up.

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:16.660
was completely healed.

00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:25.359
But everyone else in the building is dead.

00:24:25.359 --> 00:24:26.359
Who did this?

00:24:26.359 --> 00:24:28.359
It was Lex.

00:24:28.359 --> 00:24:30.359
It was one of his clones.

00:24:30.359 --> 00:24:34.279
I know, I know this sounds insane,

00:24:34.279 --> 00:24:37.279
but the real Lex was incubating dozens of them.

00:24:37.279 --> 00:24:40.279
I think he planned to use parts of their body to heal his own.

00:24:40.279 --> 00:24:49.490
Clark, but this one, this one had to be 20 years older,

00:24:49.490 --> 00:24:51.490
