00:24:51.490 --> 00:24:56.299
Why are you still alive?

00:24:56.299 --> 00:24:59.299
He told me to give you a message.

00:24:59.299 --> 00:25:01.299
He said that you'd come save me.

00:25:01.299 --> 00:25:02.299
And that when you did,

00:25:02.299 --> 00:25:05.299
It was finally time for the two of you to face off.

00:25:05.299 --> 00:25:08.299
He's in Lawson's Field.

00:25:08.299 --> 00:25:31.089
And would that I might endure his agony as well as mine.

00:25:31.089 --> 00:25:34.619
The Scarlet Letter.

00:25:34.619 --> 00:25:42.180
Of course, the letter is a mark of shame.

00:25:42.180 --> 00:25:49.180
At least it was when I found Clark tied to that post ten years ago.

00:25:49.180 --> 00:25:51.180
You know, Clark?

00:25:51.180 --> 00:25:53.180
I saved him that day.

00:25:53.180 --> 00:25:56.549
Right here in this very spot.

00:25:56.549 --> 00:25:58.549
in this very spot.

00:25:58.549 --> 00:26:01.549
And all he did was betray me.

00:26:01.549 --> 00:26:09.500
What happened to you?

00:26:09.500 --> 00:26:11.500
I've evolved.

00:26:11.500 --> 00:26:16.539
And with age...

00:26:16.539 --> 00:26:18.539
