00:26:30.559 --> 00:26:35.150
Your death will break him.

00:26:35.150 --> 00:27:03.619
Where's the real life?

00:27:03.619 --> 00:27:05.619
The Creator died two years ago.

00:27:05.619 --> 00:27:08.619
ago. Nasty truck explosion.

00:27:08.619 --> 00:27:10.619
