00:27:10.619 --> 00:27:11.619
Why am I?

00:27:11.619 --> 00:27:14.619
He created us to heal himself.

00:27:14.619 --> 00:27:21.299
He just didn't live long enough to reap the benefits.

00:27:21.299 --> 00:27:23.299
You remember this place, don't you?

00:27:23.299 --> 00:27:26.299
Not far from where we first met.

00:27:26.299 --> 00:27:28.299
The bridge.

00:27:28.299 --> 00:27:32.339
Alex would have died if I hadn't pulled him out of that car.

00:27:32.339 --> 00:27:35.339
And you never let me forget it.

00:27:35.339 --> 00:27:40.339
The truth is, by the time you dragged me to shore,

00:27:40.339 --> 00:27:41.339
something new would be.

00:27:41.339 --> 00:27:42.339
crept into your heart.

00:27:42.339 --> 00:27:43.339
Pride.

00:27:43.339 --> 00:27:47.339
The most damning of the seven deadly sins.

00:27:47.339 --> 00:27:55.980
Now you wear that pride in your chest.

00:27:55.980 --> 00:27:57.980
Right here.

00:27:57.980 --> 00:27:59.980
And that self-righteous symbol.

00:27:59.980 --> 00:28:03.740
But just beneath it,

00:28:03.740 --> 00:28:06.740
there's the darkness in your heart.

00:28:06.740 --> 00:28:09.740
Just like me,

00:28:09.740 --> 00:28:12.740
you are your own worst enemy.

00:28:12.740 --> 00:28:16.250
I'm nothing like you.

00:28:16.250 --> 00:28:21.640
Like you.

00:28:21.640 --> 00:28:22.640
We're more like brothers.

00:28:22.640 --> 00:28:26.640
you think. That's why you could never stop me.

00:28:26.640 --> 00:28:31.640
Because deep down inside, you know you brought death and destruction.

00:28:31.640 --> 00:28:34.640
The only reason anyone ever calls you a hero

00:28:34.640 --> 00:28:37.640
is because you clean up the disasters you unleash.

00:28:37.640 --> 00:28:53.410
I'm dying, Clark.

00:28:53.410 --> 00:28:56.410
Don't flatter yourself.

00:28:56.410 --> 00:28:59.690
You didn't do it.

00:28:59.690 --> 00:29:02.690
I'm just sorry that this mutated body of mine won't last long enough

00:29:02.690 --> 00:29:05.690
