00:29:05.690 --> 00:29:10.019
What did you do?

00:29:10.019 --> 00:29:14.019
There's an explosion rocking the roof of the daily planet.

00:29:14.019 --> 00:29:18.019
You can stop that beacon from plummeting into the rush hour traffic.

00:29:18.019 --> 00:29:20.019
Or?

00:29:20.019 --> 00:29:24.390
You can save the woman you love.

00:29:24.390 --> 00:29:29.019
Lois. Where is she?

00:29:29.019 --> 00:29:33.880
Even you aren't fast enough to save both.

00:29:33.880 --> 00:29:34.880
Today.

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:38.880
The world will finally lose faith in its heretic hero.

00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.880
And it will...

00:29:40.880 --> 00:29:43.259
Where is she?

00:29:43.259 --> 00:29:45.660
I first saved you.

00:29:45.660 --> 00:29:46.660
I first saved you.

00:29:46.660 --> 00:32:24.420
For a second, but I saved everyone.

00:32:24.420 --> 00:32:26.420
I don't know how, but I saved them all.

00:32:26.420 --> 00:32:30.269
Here, you sent me here to be.

00:32:30.269 --> 00:32:34.900
Vanity.

00:32:34.900 --> 00:32:36.900
You almost took a man's life,

00:32:36.900 --> 00:32:39.900
and you dare tell me you're following the path

00:32:39.900 --> 00:32:42.900
I set out for you?

00:32:42.900 --> 00:32:44.900
You told me I'd unfinished business here.

00:32:44.900 --> 00:32:46.900
An evil here that I had to face.

00:32:46.900 --> 00:32:47.900
And Lex!

00:32:47.900 --> 00:32:52.660
The evil is you, Carlis.

00:32:52.660 --> 00:32:55.660
The greatest threat Earth will face is coming.

00:32:55.660 --> 00:32:57.660
It prays on wavering soul.

00:32:57.660 --> 00:33:01.660
like yours. Once this darkness consumes you,

00:33:01.660 --> 00:33:03.660
